post.description:
Creates one or more status mappings for a specific carrier. Maps carrier-specific status descriptions to standardized CDM status codes.

Sample request:

    POST /api/mappings
    Content-Type: application/json

    {
      "carrier_name": "DHL Express",
      "mappings": [
        {
          "status_description": "Delivered",
          "status_code": "delivered"
        },
        {
          "status_description": "In Transit",
          "status_code": "in_transit"
        }
      ]
    }

**Response Codes:**
- **201**: All mappings created successfully
- **207**: Partial success (some mappings created, some failed)
- **400**: All mappings failed
